 Hindi mein bhi bolo."},{"who":"child","text":"saat… 7"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, seven matlab saat, aur numeral 7. Ab ulta ginte hain. Teen, do, ek, phir kya aayega?"},{"who":"child","text":"zero?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, ek ke baad ulta ginte hue zero aata hai. Ab taar par teen chidiyaan hain. Teeno udd jaati hain. Taar par kitni chidiyaan bachi?"},{"who":"child","text":"zero… kyunki… koi nahi bachi"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, teenon chidiyaan udd gayin, toh zero bachi. Ab cricket mein ek batsman bina ek bhi run banaye out hua. Uska score kya hai?"},{"who":"child","text":"zero… umm… duck bolte hain na cricket mein?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, cricket mein ise duck bolte hain. Score zero hota hai. Ab 6 aur 9 mein kya fark hai?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm… 6 ki golai neeche hai, 9 ki oopar"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Tumne 6 aur 9 ki golai ki jagah batayi. Bholu ne ghar ka number 6 ulta likha. Woh kehta hai, ab bhi chhah hai. Kya woh sahi hai?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm… nahi… woh 9 ban gaya na?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, Bholu sahi nahi hai. Ulta 6 likhne se 9 ban gaya. Ab bolo, nau kaun sa numeral hai?"},{"who":"child","text":"9"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, nau ka numeral 9 hai. Ab socho, do rotiyaan thi aur tumne dono kha li. Kitni bachi?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm… pata nahi…"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Koi baat nahi. Do roti thi. Ek kha li, toh ek bachi. Ab doosri bhi kha li, kitni bachi?"}],"usage":{"usd":0.07072,"tokens":43757},"boards":5,"lastMs":3643,"screen":{"on":"board","texts":["2 → 1 → ?"],"words":"the board shows writing; written on it: 2 → 1 → ?"},"learner":{"c1-maths-ch03-t02-s1":{"read":"partly","graded":[{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i01","kind":"practice"}],"grades":["correct"],"evidence":"Saat taaliyaan boli; verified grade nahi mila."},"c1-maths-ch03-t02-s2":{"read":"partly","graded":[{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i02","kind":"practice"},{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i11","ki